==English==

===Noun===
'''[[black]]-[[crested]] [[antshrike]]'''

# A [[South American]] [[passerine]] bird in the [[antbird]] family, living in undergrowth in mangrove or other swampy forest and thickets near water. Scientific names: ''Sakesphorus canadensis'' and ''Lanius canadensis''.

